sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Frontend
  participant API as Vercel API
  participant DB as Supabase DB
  participant Storage as Supabase Storage
  participant AI as AI Provider

  User->>Frontend: Enter credentials
  Frontend->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>DB: Query users + verify password
  DB-->>API: User record
  API-->>Frontend: Auth result + role
  Frontend-->>User: Logged in UI

  User->>Frontend: Upload document + metadata
  Frontend->>API: POST /documents
  API->>Storage: Store file
  Storage-->>API: File path / signed URL
  API->>DB: Create document + version
  DB-->>API: Document ID
  API-->>Frontend: Submission status

  User->>Frontend: Trigger AI analysis
  Frontend->>API: POST /documents/{id}/analyze
  API->>Storage: Download document
  Storage-->>API: PDF bytes
  API->>AI: Analyze document + propose workflow
  AI-->>API: Classification + workflow steps
  API->>DB: Create workflow + steps
  API->>DB: Update document status
  API-->>Frontend: Analysis result

  User->>Frontend: Approve / Reject step
  Frontend->>API: POST /workflows/{id}/steps/{stepId}/action
  API->>DB: Update step + create approval record
  API-->>Frontend: Updated workflow state

  User->>Frontend: Sign document
  Frontend->>API: POST /documents/{id}/sign
  API->>Storage: Download document
  Storage-->>API: PDF bytes
  API->>API: Hash + Sign (RSA-2048)
  API->>DB: Store signature
  API->>Storage: Upload signed document
  API-->>Frontend: Signed document link
  Frontend-->>User: Download signed file